  "title": "Integra LifeSciences Announces Key Executive Appointments | Integra LifeSciences",
  "summary": "Integra LifeSciences Holdings Corporation (Nasdaq: IART), a global leader in medical technology, today announced the appointment of Topaz Kirlew, DBA, MBA, as corporate vice president and chief regulatory officer. Kirlew will lead Integra's global regulatory affairs organization and oversee regulatory strategy, compliance, submissions, and transformation initiatives worldwide.",
